From: Unit OS spike <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] classicui: build with librsvg older than 2.52

rsvg_handle_get_intrinsic_size_in_pixels() appeared in librsvg 2.52.
Buildroot 2026.08.1 ships librsvg 2.50.9, so fall back to
rsvg_handle_get_dimensions() there.

Toolkit spike only (UNIT-OS-WP-0010, branch spike/toolkit-2026.08).

--- a/src/ui/classic/theme.cpp	2026-11-26 03:25:41.509536539 +0000
+++ b/src/ui/classic/theme.cpp	2026-11-26 03:25:50.499607099 +0000
@@ -239,7 +239,15 @@
 std::optional<std::pair<int, int>> svgSize(RsvgHandle *svg) {
     double w = 0;
     double h = 0;
+#if LIBRSVG_CHECK_VERSION(2, 52, 0)
     if (rsvg_handle_get_intrinsic_size_in_pixels(svg, &w, &h)) {
+#else
+    RsvgDimensionData dimensions{};
+    rsvg_handle_get_dimensions(svg, &dimensions);
+    w = dimensions.width;
+    h = dimensions.height;
+    if (w > 0 && h > 0) {
+#endif
         int width = std::max(1, static_cast<int>(std::ceil(w)));
         int height = std::max(1, static_cast<int>(std::ceil(h)));
         return std::make_pair(width, height);
